        "Absence of congenital myopathy histopathology"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "central-core-disease",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Muscle biopsy shows central cores on oxidative stains",
        "Usually lacks myasthenic-like fatigability",
        "Genetic mutations primarily in RYR1 without neuromuscular junction dysfunction"
      ]
    }
  ],
